# JMM-CYBERLAB

A collection of notes, labs, and security learning resources built for structured cybersecurity practice.

## Ignore patterns

This repository tracks learning materials, notes, and lab artifacts. Common local files and generated artifacts are ignored to keep the repo clean.

## Typical ignored files

- `.DS_Store`
- `Thumbs.db`
- `__pycache__/`
- `.venv/`
- `venv/`
- `*.log`
- `*.tmp`
- `*.bak`
- `*.swp`
- `*.zip`
- `*.tar.gz`
- `*.iso`
- `*.vmdk`
- `*.qcow2`
- `node_modules/`
- `.env`
- `.idea/`
- `.vscode/`
